From 92731cd12a5280a28ec4d67be74e73e33f3c07e8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 06:55:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Edit a diary entry and sync the change

- Diary entries get an edit link, /{baby}/edit/{type}/{id} reuses the add entry page
- AddEntryService.GetEntryAsync/UpdateEntryAsync update the row in the encrypted clone
- The change is sent as a TransactionLogOpCodeUpdate transaction when sync is enabled
